auth {
  mode: basic
}

auth:basic {
  username: admin
  password: admin123
}

docs {
  Every /api/** request needs HTTP Basic credentials that bind against the
  embedded LDAP server (see README, "Authentication (embedded LDAP)"). The
  collection authenticates as the bootstrap SuperAdmin `admin`; override the
  auth on a request to try a less privileged directory user such as
  user1/password1 (no grants until a SuperAdmin assigns a role).
}
